  levelId: level_23
  displayName: Triple Barrier - Three Diodes in Series
  description: Build a 5 V circuit using a 150 ohm current-limiting resistor, three
    forward-biased 1N4007 diodes in series, and a green LED. Verify diode polarity,
    safe current, and illumination.
